diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 2ad905f..eb84f12 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,16 @@
+yogabook-gnss (1.0.4+yb1) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Support the YB1-X90F (Android edition, YETI-11 firmware), which reports
+    Intel DMI strings and exposes the BCM4752 on ttyS2.
+  * Resolve the machine profile and UART at postinst time instead of pinning
+    Lenovo DMI and ttyS5 in the runner, health check and udev rule.
+  * Match the dedicated UART by PCI function 8086228A:01 so one rule covers
+    both editions.
+  * Accept the YB1-X91L stock ROM model string; the build id and fingerprint
+    stay pinned to the verified YB1-X90F release.
+
+ -- Michal Bicz <michal@bicz.net>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0000
+
 yogabook-gnss (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * Use Debian systemd helpers from maintainer scripts.
